  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Australia&apos;s  Voluntary Contribution - Office of the High Commissioner for Human Rights  (OHCHR)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Funding under this investment represents Australia&apos;s voluntary annual contribution to the Office of the High Commissioner for Human Rights (OHCHR).  Australia&#x2019;s contribution supports Australia&#x2019;s human rights objectives, with a particular focus on the Asia-Pacific region. The outcome of these activities is the promotion and protection of human rights globally. OHCHR, as the principal UN office mandated to promote and protect human rights, is the focal point of human rights standard setting, monitoring, research, education, public information, and advocacy activities in the UN system.</narrative>
  </description>
